# Used by run-standalone.bat's `vite build --mode standalone`.
#
# Empty, not unset: the API serves this bundle from its own origin (Jobs__SingleContainer mode),
# and its routes have no /api prefix, so the client must not prepend one. A plain shell `set`
# cannot express "set to empty" on Windows - cmd.exe treats that as unset, which would fall back
# to the wrong default - so this lives in a mode file instead, exactly like the Dockerfile's own
# `ARG VITE_API_BASE_URL=""`.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
